# The build context is the folder holding nooblyjs-core, nooblyjs-accl and nooblyjs-apps (see Dockerfile). Send only
# the four packages hero-co is built from, and none of their installed modules, data or secrets.
*
!nooblyjs-core
!nooblyjs-accl/nooblyjs-accel-customers
!nooblyjs-accl/nooblyjs-accel-payments
!nooblyjs-accl/nooblyjs-accl-infrastructure
!nooblyjs-apps/nooblyjs-apps-hero-co
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.github
**/.claude
**/.application
**/.temp
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
nooblyjs-core/tests
nooblyjs-core/examples
nooblyjs-apps/nooblyjs-apps-hero-co/test
